IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `adba-immunities`

-- Asian Development Bank Act 1966, ss 4, 5(2), 9(1), 10 and Schedule Articles 50, 51, 55, 56, 58 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_asian-development-bank-act-1966.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `s 4 -- subscription`

#ASSERT `the original subscription is within s 4(a)` 5
#ASSERT NOT `the original subscription is within s 4(a)` 5.5

#ASSERT `the total subscription is authorised` 10 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the total subscription is authorised` 12 FALSE
#ASSERT `the total subscription is authorised` 12 TRUE

