§ `Article 56(1) and s 9(1) proviso -- the Bank's own taxes`

#ASSERT `the Bank is exempt from the levy` `income tax on the Bank's income`
#ASSERT `the Bank is exempt from the levy` `customs duty on goods imported with a restriction on resale`
#ASSERT NOT `the Bank is exempt from the levy` `customs duty on goods imported with no restriction on resale`
#ASSERT NOT `the Bank is exempt from the levy` `a tax forming part of the price of goods sold to the Bank`
#ASSERT NOT `the Bank is exempt from the levy` `a charge for services rendered dressed as a tax`
#ASSERT `the Bank is exempt from the levy` `a duty to withhold tax from the Bank's payments`
#ASSERT `the Bank is exempt from the levy` `a tax on the Bank's transactions`

